		<p class="event-date small-text">November 03, 2026</p>
		<p>[Color: BLUE] The Children’s Diabetes Foundation, located in Denver, is dedicated to the support of research in diabetes and providing the best clinical and educational programs. The Foundation’s mission is to raise funds to support the Barbara Davis Center for Diabetes and its world-renowned research programs, where patients with type 1 diabetes receive the finest diabetes care available.</p>
